  "markdown": {
    "instructions": [
      "This is the official Kayko EBM third-party API documentation for Rwanda Revenue Authority (RRA) EBM 2.1.",
      "Integrators call Kayko EBM, not RRA or VSDC directly. Authenticate with a business API key (Authorization: Bearer sk_… or x-api-key).",
      "Prefer Kayko gateway field names and nested objects (for example sales customer.tin_no) over raw upstream VSDC names unless a page explicitly documents mapping.",
      "Cite the relevant docs page path when answering integration questions."
    ]
  },
